# Itens sem objetivo de conhecimento associado (diagnostico de qualidade).
PREFIX prism: <https://prism-edu.example/onto#>
PREFIX rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>

SELECT ?item ?rotulo ?edicao
WHERE {
  ?item a prism:AssessmentItem ;
        rdfs:label ?rotulo ;
        prism:inEdition ?edicao .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?item prism:assessesObjective ?oc }
}
ORDER BY ?edicao ?rotulo
LIMIT 50
